{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.poster.avif?t=1759841102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.webm?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.mp4?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life is a wager in Cheat Death, a roguelite horror game of strategy and mysticism. Navigate a cursed hex board, wield a hand of arcane cards, roll the dice and risk your soul to unravel the grim mystery at the heart of Death itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cheat Death, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a powerful hand from occult cards found on your journey. Each card is a stolen secret or a forbidden tactic, giving you a fleeting edge against the inevitable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the chance to seize victory. Rolling dice unleashes raw, unpredictable power, offering high-risk, high-reward opportunities to overcome impossible odds\u2014if you're willing to bet your life on the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is littered with eerie encounters and spectral pleas. Each event is a story waiting to be written by your choices, offering terrible bargains and glimpses into the grim world you are trapped in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c3daca813db905b0ee2be12d25cb9f24.poster.avif?t=1759841102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c3daca813db905b0ee2be12d25cb9f24.webm?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c3daca813db905b0ee2be12d25cb9f24.mp4?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756340?t=1759841102","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756340?t=1759841102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/36b9069f4b9e6b7e4b796259796a7fb86c2fdb08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759841102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/36b9069f4b9e6b7e4b796259796a7fb86c2fdb08/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759841102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.poster.avif?t=1759841102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.webm?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756340/extras/c08fbb40134f738f76593cf93e7bc11f.mp4?t=1759841102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class